{"4372420": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Interstellar Typewriter", "steam_appid": 4372420, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Interstellar Typewriter</strong> can be experienced in two ways:<br><i>play it as a game, or use it as a tool.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4372420/extras/101734db921a0f69875e05e251f3e640.avif?t=1769802415\" width=1280 height=360 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On the surface, it is a fully simulated mechanical typewriter. Beyond the keys and paper lies a mysterious room. As you type, explore your surroundings, uncover hidden interactions, and slowly piece together the truth about <strong>where you are</strong>, and <strong>who you are</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4372420/extras/b6446761708d3b75f13752e2b7fe9d34.avif?t=1769802415\" width=1280 height=360 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fully simulated mechanical typewriter</strong> -- including paper loading, carriage return, and roller movement</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Immersive interactive environment</strong> with objects to use and examine</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Save and load documents</strong> directly from your in-game sessions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Full day–night cycle</strong> that subtly changes the atmosphere as you play</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A hidden narrative</strong> that gradually unfolds the more you type</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you come to write or to uncover secrets, <i>Interstellar Typewriter</i> invites you to slow down and rediscover writing -- and yourself.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Interstellar Typewriter</strong> can be experienced in two ways:<br><i>play it as a game, or use it as a tool.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4372420/extras/101734db921a0f69875e05e251f3e640.avif?t=1769802415\" width=1280 height=360 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On the surface, it is a fully simulated mechanical typewriter. Beyond the keys and paper lies a mysterious room. As you type, explore your surroundings, uncover hidden interactions, and slowly piece together the truth about <strong>where you are</strong>, and <strong>who you are</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4372420/extras/b6446761708d3b75f13752e2b7fe9d34.avif?t=1769802415\" width=1280 height=360 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fully simulated mechanical typewriter</strong> -- including paper loading, carriage return, and roller movement</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Immersive interactive environment</strong> with objects to use and examine</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Save and load documents</strong> directly from your in-game sessions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Full day–night cycle</strong> that subtly changes the atmosphere as you play</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A hidden narrative</strong> that gradually unfolds the more you type</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you come to write or to uncover secrets, <i>Interstellar Typewriter</i> invites you to slow down and rediscover writing -- and yourself.</p>", "short_description": "A fully simulated mechanical typewriter that functions as both a game and a writing tool. Type, explore, and uncover a story hidden beneath the keys.", "supported_languages": "English, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Japanese, Simplified Chinese, Traditional Chinese", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4372420/0b4f35c388a293a41e51fa767d9aee9546260440/header.jpg?t=1769802415", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4372420/6a50ed5ac0baad4aff22b60f6690b6657f7613f0/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1769802415", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4372420/6a50ed5ac0baad4aff22b60f6690b6657f7613f0/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1769802415", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Intel® HD Graphics 630<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 500 MB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GeForce GTX 960<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": [], "developers": ["Frankly Lying"], "publishers": ["Frankly Lying"], "package_groups": [], "platforms": {"windows": true, "mac": false, "linux": false}, "categories": [{"id": 2, "description": "Single-player"}, {"id": 18, "description": "Partial Controller Support"}, {"id": 62, "description": "Family Sharing"}], "genres": [{"id": "4", "description": "Casual"}, {"id": "23", "description": "Indie"}, {"id": "28", "description": "Simulation"}], "screenshots": [{"id": 0, "path_thumbnail": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4372420/965803410edc4ece11ef872a40ccfb657de948fd/ss_965803410edc4ece11ef872a40ccfb657de948fd.600x338.jpg?t